@@section 1
@@title SQ-JG / CQ-JG Creative Compat JEI gate, JEI order skip and cycling page split, 2026-11-08 ([creative_engineering.md](../creative_engineering.md) 7.4, TODO `creativecommon/publish #3`)
@@date 2026-11-08
@@sources feature_writeup/creative_engineering.md
@@text
@@text Targets Compat `creativecompat-1.0.0` of 2026-11-08 15:49 (build/libs, NOT installed). `JeiGate` (version range [11.8.1.1034,11.9)) wraps every JEI plugin method (`CyclingCraftingJEI`, `SmithingTemplateJEI`, `PortalGunDyeJEI`, `WorldInteractionJEI`) and the script entry `JeiOrderBridge`; `jei_order.js` skips with no order defined; `CraftingProbe.page` splits variants by blank-cell pattern and `CyclingCraftingExtension` links only filled slots.
@@text
@@table
## CQ-JG-01
@group client, CEPortTesting (Common + Compat 15:49, JEI 11.80.0.1094 outside the range)
@commands launch, new world, open JEI; `grep -nE "jei_order|JEI feature|outside the tested range|broken recipe" logs/latest.log`
@pass one `outside the tested range` line from `[creativecompat]` (plugin gate) and one from the mixin plugin; `[jei_order] no order defined`; no `broken recipe`, no `could not hand the JEI order`; JEI opens and lists items
@fails `JeiGate`, the plugin wrappers, `jei_order.js`
@reviewed 2026-11-16
do {"wait": "jei"}
shell grep -nE "jei_order|JEI feature|outside the tested range|broken recipe" logs/latest.log | cut -c1-200 | head
shell [ "$(grep -c 'outside the tested range' logs/latest.log)" -ge 2 ] && grep -q "\[jei_order\] no order defined" logs/latest.log && ! grep -qE "broken recipe|could not hand the JEI order" logs/latest.log
do {"screen": "inventory"}
shot jei_list
do {"screen": "close"}
look one `outside the tested range` line from `[creativecompat]` and one from the mixin plugin (shell); JEI opens and lists items (shot). Boot preset: CEPortTesting with Common + Compat and JEI 11.80.0.1094
## CQ-JG-02
@group client, full pack (JEI 11.8.1.1034)
@commands launch, join a world, open JEI; same grep; recipes of Repair Item, Banner Duplicate, Book Cloning, Map Cloning, Firework Rocket, Firework Star, Armor Dye
@pass 0 `broken recipe` lines; `[jei cycle] built`; the pages exist, one per layout (names end `_1`, `_2` where a recipe has several); the pack JEI order still applies (CQ-CCB-02)
@fails `CraftingProbe.page`, `CyclingCraftingExtension.setRecipe`
@reviewed 2026-11-16
do {"wait": "jei"}
shell ! grep -q "broken recipe" logs/latest.log && grep -q "\[jei cycle\] built" logs/latest.log
do {"screen": "jei_recipes:minecraft:firework_rocket"}
shot firework_rocket
do {"screen": "jei_recipes:minecraft:firework_star"}
shot firework_star
do {"screen": "jei_recipes:minecraft:leather_chestplate"}
shot armor_dye
do {"screen": "jei_recipes:minecraft:white_banner"}
shot banner_duplicate
do {"screen": "jei_recipes:minecraft:written_book"}
shot book_cloning
do {"screen": "jei_recipes:minecraft:filled_map"}
shot map_cloning
do {"screen": "jei_uses:minecraft:diamond_sword"}
shot repair_item
do {"screen": "close"}
look each shot holds the special-recipe page(s), one per layout; the pack JEI order still applies (CQ-CCB-02)
## CQ-JG-03
@group client
@commands a cycling page: press R / U on a dye or tool in it
@pass every filled slot and the result cycle together
@fails the link filter in `CyclingCraftingExtension`
@reviewed 2026-11-16
do {"wait": "jei"}
do {"screen": "jei_recipes:minecraft:leather_chestplate"}
do {"wait": 10}
shot cycle_t0
do {"wait": 20}
shot cycle_t20
do {"wait": 20}
shot cycle_t40
do {"screen": "close"}
look across the three shots every filled slot and the result change together (one link set per frame); R / U from JEI inside the page is the same view as jei_recipes
